<LegalLayout
  title="About FastUUIDGenerator"
  description="Learn about our mission to provide the fastest, most secure, and completely private client-side UUID & GUID generation suite for developers."
  canonicalPath="/about/"
>
  <h2>Our Mission</h2>
  <p>
    FastUUIDGenerator was built with a single objective: to provide engineers and system architects with a lightning-fast, zero-bloat, and 100% private UUID/GUID generation tool suite.
  </p>

  <h2>Core Architectural Principles</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Zero Server Telemetry:</strong> Every single UUID is computed strictly in your browser using the native Web Cryptography API (<code>crypto.getRandomValues</code>). Your generated keys are never logged, tracked, or transmitted across the wire.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Strict RFC Compliance:</strong> We adhere rigorously to <strong>RFC 4122</strong> (UUID v1, v4, v5) and the latest <strong>RFC 9562</strong> standards (UUID v7 time-ordered identifiers).
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Static-First Performance:</strong> Built on Astro JS with minimal runtime JavaScript, our pages achieve sub-millisecond execution times and 100/100 Core Web Vitals.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Multilingual Reach:</strong> Supporting 8 major world languages with full translation parity so developers worldwide can work in their native tongue.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why We Built It</h2>
  <p>
    Most online UUID generators are bloated with heavy tracking scripts, slow server roundtrips, outdated UUID v1 implementations, or ad clutter. We created a premium, developer-focused utility that is instant, clean, and cryptographically sound.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
